concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Schedule 2,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "item 41 The later of: (a) the same time as the provision(s) covered by table item 2; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur." ;
    skos:definition "item 41 The later of: (a) the same time as the provision(s) covered by table item 2; and (b) immediately after the commencement of Schedule 1 to the Statute Stocktake (Regulatory and Other Laws) Act 2009. However, the provision(s) do not commence at all if the event mentioned in paragraph (b) does not occur."@en ;
