    values:partOf concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-8 ;
    cof:pageNumber "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Minister must consider detriment to consumers, impact on business, and public interest when prescribing terms. The upfront price is the consideration that must be provided for the supply, sale or grant under the contract." ;
