concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-8-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "8 Contracts to which this Part does not apply"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-8-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Part does not apply to:  (a) a contract of marine salvage or towage; or  (b) a charterparty of a ship; or  (c) a contract for the carriage of goods by ship.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1)(c), the reference in that subsection to a contract for the carriage of goods by ship includes a reference ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law" ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Part does not apply to:  (a) a contract of marine salvage or towage; or  (b) a charterparty of a ship; or  (c) a contract for the carriage of goods by ship.  (2) Without limiting subsection (1)(c), the reference in that subsection to a contract for the carriage of goods by ship includes a reference ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 1  The Australian Consumer Law"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "149f78e3096a648f51073c0965f954a6722a5d83afad930321ac1f7062a57096" ;
