doc:sch-2-sec-76e-ss-3 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "76E(3) Pecuniary penalties—consumer protection etc." ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The pecuniary penalty payable under subsection (1) is not to exceed the number of penalty units worked out using the following table:  Number of penalty units Item For each act or omission to which this section applies that relates to ... the number of penalty units is not to exceed ... a provision of Part IVA (a) if the person is a body corporate—10,000; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—2,000. a provision of Division 1 or 1AAA of Part V (other than section 52) (a) if the person is a body corporate—10,000; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—2,000. subsection 65C(1) or (3) or 65D(1) (a) if the person is a body corporate—10,000; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—2,000. subsection 65F(8) (a) if the person is a body corporate—150; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30. section 65G (a) if the person is a body corporate—10,000; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—2,000. subsection 65Q(9) (a) if the person is a body corporate—200; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—40. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 2  Enforcement and remedies under the Trade Practices Act 1974" ;
    cof:pageNumber "24"^^xsd:integer .

concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-22 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "22 Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 1) 2010       No. 44,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-22 ;
    values:originalText "Number of penalty units Item For each act or omission to which this section applies that relates to ... the number of penalty units is not to exceed ... subsection 65Q(9C) (a) if the person is a body corporate—300; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—60. subsection 65Q(10) (a) if the person is a body corporate—600; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—120. subsection 65R(1) (a) if the person is a body corporate—150; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30. section 87ZN (a) if the person is a body corporate—150; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30. section 87ZO (a) if the person is a body corporate—250; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—50.  (4) If conduct constitutes a contravention of 2 or more provisions referred to in paragraph (1)(a):  (a) a proceeding may be instituted under this Act against a person in relation to the contravention of any one or more of the provisions; but  (b) a person is not liable to more than one pecuniary penalty under this section in respect of the same conduct." ;
    skos:definition "Number of penalty units Item For each act or omission to which this section applies that relates to ... the number of penalty units is not to exceed ... subsection 65Q(9C) (a) if the person is a body corporate—300; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—60. subsection 65Q(10) (a) if the person is a body corporate—600; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—120. subsection 65R(1) (a) if the person is a body corporate—150; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30. section 87ZN (a) if the person is a body corporate—150; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—30. section 87ZO (a) if the person is a body corporate—250; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—50.  (4) If conduct constitutes a contravention of 2 or more provisions referred to in paragraph (1)(a):  (a) a proceeding may be instituted under this Act against a person in relation to the contravention of any one or more of the provisions; but  (b) a person is not liable to more than one pecuniary penalty under this section in respect of the same conduct."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "3177a2795e29f07381d4c2f91efa86a5672a4de938a3ab638da2a05fa892a075" ;
    cof:pageNumber "26"^^xsd:integer ;
