    skos:definition "(3) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:  (a) is issued more than 12 months after the day on which the contravention of the infringement notice provision is alleged to have occurred; or  (b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision by the person."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "703918f7197254429479eb306eec0194c1525b394d930ef0352258411e3cbdc4" ;
