concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-87zg a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "87ZG Amount of penalty"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-87zg ;
    values:originalText "The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice that is to be issued to a person must be a pecuniary penalty equal to the number of penalty units worked out using the following table:  Number of penalty units Item If the infringement notice is for an alleged contravention of ... the number of penalty units is ... a provision of Part IVA (a) if the person is a body corporate—60; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—12. a provision of Division 1 or 1AAA of Part V (other than section 52, paragraph 53A(1)(c), section 54, subsection 56(1) or section 58 or 64) (a) if the person is a body corporate—60; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—12. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 2  Enforcement and remedies under the Trade Practices Act 1974" ;
    skos:definition "The penalty to be specified in an infringement notice that is to be issued to a person must be a pecuniary penalty equal to the number of penalty units worked out using the following table:  Number of penalty units Item If the infringement notice is for an alleged contravention of ... the number of penalty units is ... a provision of Part IVA (a) if the person is a body corporate—60; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—12. a provision of Division 1 or 1AAA of Part V (other than section 52, paragraph 53A(1)(c), section 54, subsection 56(1) or section 58 or 64) (a) if the person is a body corporate—60; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—12. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 2  Enforcement and remedies under the Trade Practices Act 1974"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "9f5673473af5ad1a4e9d12374f3e4ffcd4e6c4f2f6b32728f23814b7e1f1272a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "41"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Specify a pecuniary penalty equal to the number of penalty units" ;
    dc:description "penalty amount" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
