concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-38 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "38 Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 1) 2010       No. 44,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-38 ;
    values:originalText "Number of penalty units Item If the infringement notice is for an alleged contravention of ... the number of penalty units is ... subsection 65C(1) or (3) or 65D(1) or section 65G (a) if the person is a body corporate—60; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—12. section 87ZN (a) if the person is a body corporate—30; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—6. section 87ZO (a) if the person is a body corporate—50; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—10." ;
    skos:definition "Number of penalty units Item If the infringement notice is for an alleged contravention of ... the number of penalty units is ... subsection 65C(1) or (3) or 65D(1) or section 65G (a) if the person is a body corporate—60; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—12. section 87ZN (a) if the person is a body corporate—30; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—6. section 87ZO (a) if the person is a body corporate—50; or (b) if the person is not a body corporate—10."@en ;
