concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-87zj-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "87ZJ(6) Infringement notice compliance period for infringement notice"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-87zj-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Act to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 2  Enforcement and remedies under the Trade Practices Act 1974" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If the Commission extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Act to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended. ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 2  Enforcement and remedies under the Trade Practices Act 1974"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f1f3c96e790646821b9d0857e6a5fed142f2cbfc6d81f572b159246574f18edb" ;
    values:partOf concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-2-sec-87zj ;
    cof:pageNumber "43"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reference to extended infringement notice compliance period is taken to be a reference to the extended period." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
