    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
    cml:operator "must consider" ;
    cml:logicSummary "Must consider conduct" ;
    cml:premiseText "(2) In determining under subsection (1) whether the disqualification is justified, the Court must have regard to:  (a) the person’s conduct in relation to the management, business or property of any corporation;" ;
    cml:conclusionText "The Court must consider this conduct." ;
    cml:executionSurface "modalities::logic::deontic" ;
    cml:confidence "1.0000"^^xsd:decimal ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .
doc:sch-3-sec-14-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "14(2) Before section 12GM" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) In determining under subsection (1) whether the disqualification is justified, the Court may have regard to:  (a) the person’s conduct in relation to the management, business or property of any corporation; and  (b) any other matters that the Court considers appropriate. Corporations Act 2001" ;
    cof:pageNumber "64"^^xsd:integer .

