concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-3-sec-206eb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "206EB Disqualification under the ASIC Act"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-206eb ;
    values:originalText "A person is disqualified from managing corporations if a court order disqualifying the person from managing corporations is in force under section 12GLD of the ASIC Act." ;
