doc:sch-3-sec-12gx-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "12GX(2) Purpose and effect of this Subdivision" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) ASIC must not issue more than one infringement notice to the person for the same alleged contravention of the infringement notice provision." ;
    cof:pageNumber "74"^^xsd:integer .

concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-3-sec-12gx-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "12GX(3) Purpose and effect of this Subdivision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-12gx-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:  (a) is issued more than 12 months after the day on which the contravention of the infringement notice provision is alleged to have occurred; or  (b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision by the person. 12GXB  Matters to be included in an infringement notice  An infringement notice must:  (a) be identified by a unique number; and  (b) state the day on which it is issued; and  (c) state the name and address of the person to whom it is issued; and  (d) state that it is being issued by ASIC; and  (e) state how ASIC may be contacted; and  (f) give details of the alleged contravention by the person, including:  (i) the date of the alleged contravention; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 3  Amendment of corporations legislation" ;
    skos:definition "(3) The infringement notice does not have any effect if the notice:  (a) is issued more than 12 months after the day on which the contravention of the infringement notice provision is alleged to have occurred; or  (b) relates to more than one alleged contravention of an infringement notice provision by the person. 12GXB  Matters to be included in an infringement notice  An infringement notice must:  (a) be identified by a unique number; and  (b) state the day on which it is issued; and  (c) state the name and address of the person to whom it is issued; and  (d) state that it is being issued by ASIC; and  (e) state how ASIC may be contacted; and  (f) give details of the alleged contravention by the person, including:  (i) the date of the alleged contravention; and ComLaw Authoritative Act C2010A00044  Schedule 3  Amendment of corporations legislation"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "81b2c43b642aa5bff5fe03f28ffc42d1821064b0493a134ce29e34dd78884316" ;
