concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-3-sec-74-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "74(6) Trade Practices Amendment (Australian Consumer Law) Act (No. 1) 2010       No. 44,"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-74-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) If ASIC extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Act to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended. 12GXG  Withdrawal of an infringement notice Representations to ASIC" ;
    skos:definition "(6) If ASIC extends the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice, a reference in this Act to the infringement notice compliance period for an infringement notice is taken to be a reference to the infringement notice compliance period as so extended. 12GXG  Withdrawal of an infringement notice Representations to ASIC"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "1218f3be9341a75b83c573524ee6b08a1fd1ff712d0cbdc8fdcd87c3df911407" ;
    values:partOf concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-3-sec-74 ;
    cof:pageNumber "78"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Reference to infringement notice compliance period is taken to be the extended period. Withdrawal notice must be given within infringement notice compliance period." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
