concept:trade-practices-amendment-australian-consumer-law-act-sch-3-sec-45 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "45 Paragraph 12GNB(1)(a)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-45 ;
    values:originalText "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) a person:  (i) engaged in conduct (the contravening conduct) in contravention of a provision of Subdivision C or D; or  (ii) is a party to a consumer contract who is advantaged by a term (the declared term) of the contract in relation to which the Court has made a declaration under section 12GND; and" ;
    skos:definition "Repeal the paragraph, substitute:  (a) a person:  (i) engaged in conduct (the contravening conduct) in contravention of a provision of Subdivision C or D; or  (ii) is a party to a consumer contract who is advantaged by a term (the declared term) of the contract in relation to which the Court has made a declaration under section 12GND; and"@en ;
